case bad-roster-framing
desc a row outside the stream, an END without BEGIN, a bad count, a stream never closed
recv system TBM:ROSTER|101|Alpha|1|online|1|Elwynn Forest|-|Warrior
recv system TBM:ROSTER_END
recv system TBM:ROSTER_BEGIN|two
recv system TBM:ROSTER_BEGIN|1
expect roster.committed false
expect problems.count 4
expect problem.0 row-outside-stream
expect problem.1 end-without-begin
expect problem.2 bad-number
expect problem.3 unterminated-stream
